const guide=w=>`<div class="guide"><img src="${PIC(w==='E'?'elara':'paul')}" alt="${w==='E'?'Elara':'Paul'}"><b>${w==='E'?'Elara':'Paul'}</b></div>`;
const consigne=(k,w)=>{w=w||GUIDE[k]||'P';return `<div class="consigne">${guide(w)}<div class="ic" aria-hidden="true">${ICON[k]||'👉'}</div><div><div class="fr">${fr(k)} ${A(fr(k),w==='E'?'F':'M')}</div>${TB(k)}</div></div>`;};
const TAGS={CO:'🎧 Compréhension orale',CE:'📖 Compréhension écrite',EO:'🗣️ Expression orale',EE:'✍️ Expression écrite',LG:'🧠 Langue',IC:'🌍 Interculturel',IO:'🤝 Interaction',MD:'🔄 Médiation'};
const head=(tags,title)=>`<div>${tags.map(t=>`<span class="tag t-${t==='IC'||t==='MD'?'lg':t==='IO'?'eo':t.toLowerCase()}">${TAGS[t]}</span>`).join('')}</div><h2>${title}</h2>`;
const fbOK=(k='bravo',extra='')=>`✅ ${fr(k)} ${extra} ${T(k)}`;
const fbKO=(k='again',extra='')=>`❌ ${fr(k)} ${extra} ${T(k)}`;
function setFb(el,ok,html){if(!el)return;el.classList.add('fb');el.classList.remove('ok','ko');el.classList.add(ok?'ok':'ko');el.innerHTML=html;paintTr(el);}
/* ---------- 🎥 Lecteur vidéo de Fidèle Fle : dans la page ou en plein écran, sans quitter la page ---------- */
function ytId(u){const m=String(u).match(/(?:youtu\.be\/|[?&]v=|embed\/|shorts\/|live\/)([\w-]{11})/);return m?m[1]:null;}
function vSrc(u){u=String(u||'').trim();let m;const y=ytId(u);
  if(y)return{type:'frame',src:`https://www.youtube.com/embed/${y}?rel=0&playsinline=1&modestbranding=1&autoplay=1`,poster:`https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${y}/hqdefault.jpg`};
  if((m=u.match(/vimeo\.com\/(?:video\/)?(\d+)/)))return{type:'frame',src:`https://player.vimeo.com/video/${m[1]}?autoplay=1&playsinline=1`,poster:''};
  if((m=u.match(/drive\.google\.com\/(?:file\/d\/|open\?id=)([\w-]{20,})/)))return{type:'frame',src:`https://drive.google.com/file/d/${m[1]}/preview`,poster:''};
  return{type:'file',src:u,poster:''};}
function video(key,compact){const u=CONFIG.videos[key];if(!u&&!CONFIG.showEmptyVideo)return'';
  const head=`<div class="vh"><span class="av">FF</span><span>🎥 ${fr('video')} ${T('video')}</span></div>`;
  if(!u)return `<div class="video ${compact?'compact':''}">${head}<div class="frame"><span aria-hidden="true">🎬</span></div><p class="small" style="text-align:center;margin:6px 0 0">${fr('videoSoon')} ${T('videoSoon')}</p></div>`;
  const v=vSrc(u);
  return `<div class="video ${compact?'compact':''}" data-vkey="${key}">${head}<div class="frame"><button type="button" class="vposter" aria-label="▶️ ${fr('vWatch')}"${v.poster?` style="background-image:url('${v.poster}')"`:''}><span class="vplay" aria-hidden="true">▶</span></button></div>
  <div class="vbar"><button type="button" class="vb vwatch">▶️ ${fr('vWatch')} ${T('vWatch')}</button><button type="button" class="vb vfull">⛶ ${fr('vFull')} ${T('vFull')}</button><button type="button" class="vb vclose" hidden>✕ ${fr('vClose')} ${T('vClose')}</button></div></div>`;}
function vLoad(box){const fr_=box.querySelector('.frame');if(fr_.querySelector('iframe,video'))return fr_.querySelector('video');
  const v=vSrc(CONFIG.videos[box.dataset.vkey]);
  if(v.type==='frame'){fr_.innerHTML=`<iframe src="${v.src}" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" title="Vidéo de Fidèle Fle"></iframe>`;return null;}
  fr_.innerHTML=`<video src="${v.src}" controls playsinline preload="metadata"></video>`;const el=fr_.querySelector('video');try{const p=el.play();if(p&&p.catch)p.catch(()=>{});}catch(e){}return el;}
const fsEl=()=>document.fullscreenElement||document.webkitFullscreenElement||null;
function vUI(box){const on=box.classList.contains('vbig')||fsEl()===box;const c=box.querySelector('.vclose');if(c)c.hidden=!on;}
function vBig(box,on){if(on&&typeof tallFrame==='function'&&tallFrame()){postParent({y:Math.max(0,box.getBoundingClientRect().top+scrollY-10)});return;}box.classList.toggle('vbig',on);document.documentElement.style.overflow=on?'hidden':'';vUI(box);if(on){const c=box.querySelector('.vclose');if(c)c.focus();}}
function vFull(box){const el=vLoad(box);
  const req=box.requestFullscreen||box.webkitRequestFullscreen;
  if(req&&(document.fullscreenEnabled||document.webkitFullscreenEnabled)){
    try{const p=req.call(box);if(p&&p.then)p.then(()=>vUI(box)).catch(()=>vBig(box,true));else setTimeout(()=>{if(fsEl()!==box)vBig(box,true);},300);}catch(e){vBig(box,true);}
    return;}
  if(el&&el.webkitEnterFullscreen){try{el.webkitEnterFullscreen();return;}catch(e){}}
  vBig(box,true);}
function vClose(box){if(fsEl()===box){(document.exitFullscreen||document.webkitExitFullscreen).call(document);}
  vBig(box,false);}
if(!window.__fphVideo){window.__fphVideo=1;
  document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const box=e.target.closest('#fph-l2 .video[data-vkey]');if(!box)return;
    if(e.target.closest('.vposter,.vwatch')){vLoad(box);box.querySelector('.frame').scrollIntoView({block:'nearest',behavior:'smooth'});}
    else if(e.target.closest('.vfull'))vFull(box);
    else if(e.target.closest('.vclose'))vClose(box);});
  const onFs=()=>document.querySelectorAll('#fph-l2 .video[data-vkey]').forEach(vUI);
  document.addEventListener('fullscreenchange',onFs);document.addEventListener('webkitfullscreenchange',onFs);
  document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){const b=document.querySelector('#fph-l2 .video.vbig');if(b)vClose(b);}});}
const choice=(txt,cls='')=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.className='choice '+cls;b.textContent=txt;return b;};
const sp=(n,g)=>`<b>${n}</b>`;
const bulle=(n,g,t)=>`<div class="bulle ${['F','Sf','Tg','Tg2'].includes(g)?'e':g==='C'?'c':'p'}"><b>${n}</b>${S(t,g)} ${T(EXP[t])}</div>`;

/* ---------- Points ---------- */
const SC={CO:[0,0],CE:[0,0],EO:[0,0],EE:[0,0]};const counted=new Set();
function award(k,c,ok,max=1){if(counted.has(k))return;counted.add(k);SC[c][1]+=max;SC[c][0]+=(ok===true?max:(ok||0));$('#score').textContent='⭐ '+Object.values(SC).reduce((a,b)=>a+b[0],0);}


/* ---------- 🔒 Verrouillage progressif (version élèves) ---------- */
const LOCK=!!CONFIG.lock;
const REQ={1:['rev'],2:['dial'],3:['mots'],4:['tuvous','fi'],5:['verbe','ench'],6:['yu','into2'],7:['badge','ordre'],8:['dnd','dict','badgeW','msgmf','msgmi'],9:['lv1','lv2','role'],10:['mem','touch','letters','formel','reply'],11:['conv','wint','med1','med2']};
const DONE=new Set();if(LOCK){try{JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fph-l2-lock')||'[]').forEach(x=>DONE.add(x));}catch(e){}}
function saveDone(){if(!LOCK)return;try{localStorage.setItem('fph-l2-lock',JSON.stringify([...DONE]));}catch(e){}}
const stepDone=i=>REQ[i]?REQ[i].every(k=>DONE.has(k)):DONE.has('v'+i);
const unlocked=i=>!LOCK||[...Array(i).keys()].every(stepDone);
function doneK(k){if(DONE.has(k))return;DONE.add(k);saveDone();
  if(LOCK&&REQ[cur]&&REQ[cur].includes(k)&&stepDone(cur)){buildNav();refreshNext();const li=ROOT.querySelector('.lockinfo');if(li)li.remove();
    if(cur<STEPS.length-1){toast('🔓 '+fr('L_unlocked'));confetti();}}}
function refreshNext(){const b=ROOT.querySelector('#fnav .next');if(!b||b.classList.contains('done'))return;const lk=LOCK&&!stepDone(cur);b.disabled=lk;
  b.innerHTML=lk?`<span>🔒 ${fr('next')}</span>${T('next')}`:`<span>${fr('next')} →</span>${T('next')}`;paintTr(b);}
/* activité ratée : on ne propose que les questions non réussies */
function retryBox(host,n,fn){const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='sit redo';
  d.innerHTML=`<div class="gsay" style="justify-content:center">${gAv('E',1)}<div class="gb" style="text-align:left"><b>Elara</b><div class="big">❌ ${n} · ${S(fr('L_redo'),'F')}</div>${TB('L_redo')}</div></div><div class="row center" style="margin-top:10px"><button class="btn jaune big rdo">🔁 ${fr('L_redoBtn')} (${n}) ${T('L_redoBtn')}</button></div>`;
  host.appendChild(d);paintTr(d);$('.rdo',d).onclick=()=>{stopAudio();d.remove();fn();};}
/* série de cartes : les cartes ratées se rouvrent seules */
function Kit(key,host,total){let left=total,wrong=[];const box=document.createElement('div');host.appendChild(box);
  return {answer(ok,reset){left--;if(!ok)wrong.push(reset);if(left>0)return;
    if(!wrong.length){doneK(key);return;}
    if(LOCK){const w=wrong;wrong=[];retryBox(box,w.length,()=>{left=w.length;w.forEach(f=>f());});}}};}

/* ---------- Micro : enregistrer sa voix ---------- */
let REC=null,REC_BTN=null,MIC_ID='';
function stopRec(){try{if(REC&&REC.state==='recording')REC.stop();}catch(e){}}
const inFrame=(()=>{try{return window.self!==window.top;}catch(e){return true;}})();
const micBtn=(label=true,P)=>`<span class="micw"${P?` data-act="${esc(P.act)}" data-lab="${esc(P.lab||'')}" data-reg="${P.reg||''}" data-max="${P.max||10}"${P.priv?' data-priv="1"':''}`:''}><button class="btn rouge sm mic">🎙️ ${label?fr('record')+' '+T('record'):''}</button><span class="myv"></span>${P?'<span class="schip"></span>':''}</span>`;
function bindMics(root,onDone){root.querySelectorAll('.micw').forEach(w=>{if(w.dataset.b)return;w.dataset.b=1;$('.mic',w).onclick=()=>toggleRec($('.mic',w),w,onDone);});}
function micHelp(w){let m=w.querySelector('.recmsg');if(!m){m=document.createElement('div');m.className='recmsg';m.style.flexBasis='100%';w.appendChild(m);}
  const url=CONFIG.lessonUrl||(/^https?:/.test(location.href)&&!/googleusercontent|sites\.google/.test(location.href)?location.href:'');
  m.innerHTML=`<p class="small" style="margin:6px 0">🎙️❌ ${fr(inFrame?'openTab':'noMic')} ${T(inFrame?'openTab':'noMic')}</p>`+(inFrame&&url?`<a class="btn sm" href="${url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">↗️ 🎙️</a>`:'');paintTr(m);}
async function listMics(){try{const d=(await navigator.mediaDevices.enumerateDevices()).filter(x=>x.kind==='audioinput');if(d.length<2)return;
  document.querySelectorAll('.micsel').forEach(z=>{if(z.firstChild)return;const s=document.createElement('select');s.style.cssText='font-size:16px;padding:6px;border-radius:10px';d.forEach((m,i)=>{const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=m.deviceId;o.textContent='🎙️ '+(m.label||('Micro '+(i+1)));s.appendChild(o);});s.value=MIC_ID||d[0].deviceId;s.onchange=()=>{MIC_ID=s.value;};z.appendChild(s);});}catch(e){}}
async function toggleRec(btn,w,onDone){
  if(REC&&REC.state==='recording'){const same=REC_BTN===btn;REC.stop();if(same)return;}
  if(!navigator.mediaDevices||!navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia||!window.MediaRecorder){micHelp(w);return;}
  try{stopAudio();
    const stream=await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({audio:MIC_ID?{deviceId:{exact:MIC_ID}}:true});listMics();
    const ch=[],rec=new MediaRecorder(stream),orig=btn.innerHTML;REC=rec;REC_BTN=btn;
    rec.ondataavailable=e=>{if(e.data.size)ch.push(e.data);};
    rec.onstop=()=>{try{stream.getTracks().forEach(t=>t.stop());}catch(e){}
      const blob=new Blob(ch,{type:rec.mimeType||'audio/webm'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);w._blob=blob;$('.myv',w).innerHTML=`<audio controls src="${url}"></audio>`;
      btn.classList.remove('on');btn.innerHTML=orig;if(REC===rec){REC=null;REC_BTN=null;}const m=w.querySelector('.recmsg');if(m)m.innerHTML='';onDone&&onDone(w);
      if(w.dataset.act&&blob.size>800)sendProd({activity:w.dataset.act,label:w.dataset.lab,register:w.dataset.reg||'',mode:'oral',blob,private:w.dataset.priv==='1'},w.querySelector('.schip'));};
    rec.start();btn.classList.add('on');btn.innerHTML=`⏹️ ${fr('stop')} ${T('stop')}`;paintTr(btn);
    setTimeout(()=>{if(rec.state==='recording')rec.stop();},(+(w.dataset.max||10))*1000);
  }catch(e){micHelp(w);}
}
/* répéter 3 fois */
function repeat3(host,text,g,onDone,compact){host.innerHTML=`<button class="btn jaune rp" title="${esc(fr('L_rep'))}">🔁 ${compact?'× 3':fr('L_rep')+' '+T('L_rep')}</button> <span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>`;
  let n=0;$('.rp',host).onclick=()=>{PLAY++;speakSafe(text,{g},()=>{if(n<3){host.querySelectorAll('.dots i')[n].classList.add('on');n++;if(n===3){onDone&&onDone();}}});};paintTr(host);}

/* ---------- Navigation ---------- */
const STEPS=[['0. Bienvenue',rAccueil],['1. Je me souviens',rRappel],['2. J\'écoute',rDialogues],['3. Les mots',rMots],['4. Tu ou vous ?',rTuVous],['5. Je m\'appelle, je suis',rVerbes],['6. Les sons',rSons],['7. Je lis',rLire],['8. J\'écris',rEcrire],['9. Je parle',rParler],['10. Je joue 🎮',rJeux],['11. On se parle ! 🤝',rOnParle],['12. Bilan',rBilan],['13. Test 📝',rTest]];
let cur=0;const visited=new Set([0]);
function buildNav(){const n=$('#steps');n.innerHTML='';STEPS.forEach(([l],i)=>{const b=document.createElement('button');const lk=!unlocked(i);b.textContent=(lk?'🔒 ':'')+l;b.className=i===cur?'on':(LOCK?stepDone(i):visited.has(i))?'done':'';if(lk){b.disabled=true;b.classList.add('lock');}b.onclick=()=>go(i);n.appendChild(b);});$('#bar').style.width=cur/(STEPS.length-1)*100+'%';}
function scrollTopLesson(){try{const r=ROOT.getBoundingClientRect();if(r.top<-4||r.top>window.innerHeight*.5){const y=window.pageYOffset+r.top-(EMB?0:(CONFIG.headerOffset||0));window.scrollTo({top:Math.max(0,y),behavior:'smooth'});}}catch(e){}}
function go(i){if(!unlocked(i)){toast('🔒 '+fr('L_locked'));return;}stopAudio();stopRec();cur=i;visited.add(i);if(!REQ[i]){DONE.add('v'+i);saveDone();}buildNav();const st=$('#stage');st.innerHTML='';st.style.position='relative';STEPS[i][1](st);
  const nav=$('#fnav'),last=i===STEPS.length-1;
  nav.innerHTML=`<button class="fbtn prev" ${i>0?'':'disabled'}><span>← ${fr('prev')}</span>${T('prev')}</button><span class="fstep">${i+1} / ${STEPS.length}</span>`+(last?`<button class="fbtn next done" disabled><span>🏁 ✅</span></button>`:`<button class="fbtn next"><span>${fr('next')} →</span>${T('next')}</button>`);
  $('.prev',nav).onclick=()=>{if(cur>0)go(cur-1);};if(!last)$('.next',nav).onclick=()=>go(cur+1);refreshNext();
  if(LOCK&&REQ[i]&&!stepDone(i))st.insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',`<div class="lockinfo">🔒 ${fr('L_locked')} ${T('L_locked')}</div>`);
  paintTr(st);paintTr(nav);bindMics(st);scrollTopLesson();if(typeof postParent==='function')postParent({top:1});
  const first=st.querySelector('[data-hint]');if(first)setTimeout(()=>hint(first),800);}

/* ---------- Palier 1 : unités et fin du palier (même modèle pour tous les paliers) ---------- */
const PALIER={num:1,lesson:2,lessons:13,next:'🌿 Palier 2 · Pré-A1.2',units:[
 ['🙋','Unité 1 · Moi – Bonjour ! Comment tu t\'appelles ?','Leçons 1 et 2'],
 ['👥','Unité 2 · Les autres – C\'est qui ?','Leçons 3 et 4'],
 ['⏰','Unité 3 · Le temps – On est quel jour ?','Leçons 5 et 6'],
 ['📍','Unité 4 · Les lieux – Tu habites où ?','Leçons 7 et 8'],
 ['🛒','Unité 5 · Les besoins – Qu\'est-ce que c\'est ?','Leçons 9 et 10'],
 ['🎨','Unité 6 · Goûts et sorties – Tu aimes quoi ?','Leçons 11 et 12'],
 ['🏆','Projet et bilan : Ma carte de visite sonore','Leçon 13 · test du palier']]};
function roadmap(){return `<div class="road"><h3>🧭 ${fr('L_road')} ${T('L_road')}</h3><ol class="rlist">${PALIER.units.map((u,k)=>`<li class="${k===0?'here':''}${k===PALIER.units.length-1?' proj':''}"><span class="ri">${u[0]}</span><span>${u[1]}<span class="rl">${u[2]}${k===0?' · 📍 '+PALIER.lesson+' ✅':''}</span></span></li>`).join('')}</ol></div>`;}
function finCard(icon,k,extra=''){const t=fr(k),i=t.indexOf(' : ');const lab=t.slice(0,i),txt=t.slice(i+3);
  return `<div class="fcard"><div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between"><span class="fi">${icon}</span>${A(t)}</div><div class="ft"><b>${lab}</b> : ${txt}</div>${TB(k)}${extra}</div>`;}
function finPalier(){return `<section class="finp" aria-label="${esc(fr('L_finT'))}"><h2>🏁 ${fr('L_finT')} ${A(fr('L_finT'))} ${T('L_finT')}</h2>
  <div class="small" style="font-weight:800;color:#1B5E20">📍 ${PALIER.lesson} / ${PALIER.lessons} ✅ → … → 🏆 ${PALIER.lessons} → 📝 → ${PALIER.next}</div>
  <div class="fgrid">${finCard('🎬','L_fin1')}${finCard('✅','L_fin2')}${finCard('📝','L_fin3',`<div class="skills"><span>👂 /25</span><span>📖 /25</span><span>🗣️ /25</span><span>✍️ /25</span></div><div class="pass"><span class="sc">≥ 60/100 · ≥ 10/25</span>→<span class="to">${PALIER.next}</span></div>`)}</div></section>`;}

